# Vercel resolves Python dependencies with uv whenever it sees pyproject.toml, and
# uv.lock here is stale (it predates trafilatura/playwright/pymupdf/ebooklib/mobi and
# flask-caching being added to pyproject.toml). `uv sync --locked` therefore fails its
# consistency check, and `uv sync` without --locked would pull Playwright and pymupdf
# and exceed the function bundle limit.
#
# Hiding these files makes Vercel fall back to pip against requirements.txt, which is
# the curated runtime set for this project.
uv.lock
pyproject.toml
Pipfile
Pipfile.lock
poetry.lock
